NO LICENCE IS GRANTED
─────────────────────
This repository and the site it serves at https://theatrium.list.devinos.hr
are published for one purpose only: so that guests of Restoran Theatrium can
read the drinks list on a tablet or through the QR code on the table.

Publication is not publication under any open-source or open-data licence, and
nothing here may be treated as public domain. No right to use, copy, reproduce,
adapt, translate, modify, publish, transmit, distribute, sublicense, sell, host
or create derivative works from any part of it is granted, by implication,
estoppel or otherwise.

WHAT IS PROTECTED
─────────────────
1. THE DATABASE. `library/wines.json`, `lists/theatrium.json`, `data/*.json`
   and the vocabularies in `js/i18n.js`, `js/spirits.js` and `js/zh-terms.js`
   are a database within the meaning of Directive 96/9/EC and the Croatian Act
   on Copyright and Related Rights. Apelacija d.o.o. asserts the sui generis
   database right in it: the substantial investment in obtaining, verifying and
   presenting its contents is the work of professional sommeliers and
   translators over many months.

   Extraction or re-utilisation of the whole or of any substantial part of that
   database is prohibited. So is the repeated and systematic extraction or
   re-utilisation of insubstantial parts.

2. THE TEXTS. Every tasting note, producer profile, region description,
   distillery note and food-pairing text, and every one of their translations
   into Croatian, English, Italian, French, German, Slovenian, Spanish and
   Chinese, is an original literary work. They are written in an identifiable
   individual voice, which makes copies straightforward to recognise.

3. THE ARTWORK. The region maps, glassware and vessel icons, section ornaments,
   drawn flags and every other graphic asset in `assets/`, `js/maps.js` and
   `js/app.js`, including the photographic assets derived from the sculptures
   in the restaurant's atrium.

4. THE SOFTWARE. All source in `js/`, `css/`, `scripts/`, `tests/` and the HTML
   pages, together with its structure, sequence and organisation.

5. THE MARKS. "Theatrium", "Theatrium by Filho", the Theatrium logo and the
   atrium sculptures are the property of Apelacija d.o.o. Nothing here grants
   any trademark, trade-dress or publicity right, and no permission is given to
   present any derivative work in a way that suggests association with,
   endorsement by, or origin from Restoran Theatrium.

