────────────────────────────────────────────────
Apelacija d.o.o. expressly reserves all rights of text and data mining under
Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790. No part of this work may be used for
text or data mining, nor for the training, fine-tuning, evaluation, grounding
or retrieval-augmentation of any machine-learning or artificial-intelligence
system, whether commercial or not.

This reservation is made in machine-readable form in `robots.txt`,
`/.well-known/tdmrep.json` and the `tdm-reservation` meta element of every page,
and applies whether or not any given crawler chooses to read them.

